  "conversionNotes": {
    "generic": "Each configured application produces a monomorphic Python function. The open declaration is absent. Name a closed generic structure application with an abbrev to get a host record with instantiated fields. Configured functions over these records, List aliases and Option aliases use ordinary concrete signatures.",
